Package: essexwaterdashboard
Title: Essex County Water Dashboard
Version: 0.1.0
Description: Shiny dashboard for the Parker and Ipswich River watersheds.
    A scheduled ETL script pulls USGS streamflow, groundwater, and
    precipitation (USGS OGC API) and U.S. Drought Monitor data into a
    local SQLite store; the app reads only from that store.
Encoding: UTF-8
Imports: shiny, bslib, shinyWidgets, plotly, htmltools, httr2,
    jsonlite, yaml, DBI, RSQLite, leaflet
Suggests: testthat (>= 3.0.0), shinytest2, mockery, httptest2, chromote,
    lintr, withr
Config/testthat/edition: 3
